01:31.327 --> 01:36.827
The Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu

01:38.547 --> 01:40.177
I-Is that...?!

01:40.427 --> 01:41.177
That's the...!

01:41.627 --> 01:43.047
<i>There's no mistaking it.</i>

02:01.257 --> 02:02.337
Yeah...

02:03.967 --> 02:05.177
That's...

02:12.757 --> 02:13.877
The Ten Tails!

02:30.177 --> 02:32.837
But I thought the Statue's evil chakra
had disappeared!

02:33.217 --> 02:34.627
Damn it! They got us!

02:35.127 --> 02:38.047
That thing doesn't have
 those kinds of emotions or feelings!

02:39.257 --> 02:41.047
It can't be sensed.

02:41.797 --> 02:44.507
It's Natural Energy itself.

02:44.547 --> 02:47.047
It's the same as that which
circulates around the world,

02:47.047 --> 02:50.797
that you can feel in
the soil, water, and the air.

02:51.547 --> 02:53.677
It would be a different story
if you tried it

02:53.717 --> 02:57.047
while engaged in Sage Mode though.

02:57.837 --> 02:58.837
Got it!

02:59.257 --> 03:01.757
So if you say he's all Nature Energy,

03:02.047 --> 03:04.127
then I can check him out!

03:04.427 --> 03:06.047
Forget it, Naruto...

03:06.587 --> 03:09.177
Even if you tried something like that...

03:12.087 --> 03:15.627
All you'll see is just
how immeasurable it is.

03:18.177 --> 03:19.427
You're not kidding.

03:25.257 --> 03:29.427
I had planned to capture them
before the Ten Tails revived, but...

03:30.087 --> 03:31.467
They're pretty good.

03:32.177 --> 03:34.967
I want to start the Infinite Tsukuyomi
ritual immediately.

03:36.427 --> 03:40.087
That Great Genjutsu requires time
to summon the moon.

03:40.877 --> 03:43.177
They will interfere with the jutsu.

03:43.177 --> 03:45.047
Things will go more smoothly

03:45.087 --> 03:47.507
if we use the Statue's power
to get rid of them first.

03:48.047 --> 03:49.047
Don't you agree?

03:50.127 --> 03:51.047
Madara...

03:51.467 --> 03:54.427
You just want to test
the Ten Tails' power, don't you?

03:55.297 --> 03:56.377
That's why you deliberately...

03:58.047 --> 03:59.757
You're like a child.

04:00.177 --> 04:01.257
No.

04:01.927 --> 04:05.377
Brats are impatient, touchy fools.

04:12.427 --> 04:14.717
Hey... Here comes a big one.

04:14.967 --> 04:16.677
You think we can really do this?

04:17.007 --> 04:19.217
Don't think you can hide
under your tentacles

04:19.257 --> 04:21.007
'cuz you're scared!

04:21.127 --> 04:23.967
But first, hand me Guy over there.

04:24.507 --> 04:26.467
I'll heal him later.

04:27.257 --> 04:29.587
And that Naruto and Kakashi too!

04:30.087 --> 04:30.717
Yeah!

04:30.927 --> 04:31.677
Here you go!

04:37.627 --> 04:38.587
Listen up.

04:38.627 --> 04:41.177
First, we keep our distance
and see what move he makes!

04:41.297 --> 04:43.587
Then we'll counter the attack

04:43.627 --> 04:46.337
and hit him with a big blow
as close as we can get.

04:47.467 --> 04:48.967
Just like I said earlier!

04:49.677 --> 04:51.677
Nine Tails,
you're acting like a captain.

04:52.177 --> 04:54.177
Huh? You got a problem with that?!

04:54.297 --> 04:55.337
Nope...

04:55.377 --> 04:57.127
In fact, I feel kind of happy!

05:00.677 --> 05:02.257
That line...

05:03.257 --> 05:04.627
Save it for after we've won!

05:05.547 --> 05:06.427
Let's go!

05:23.177 --> 05:24.427
<i>It's surprisingly fast...</i>

05:24.717 --> 05:27.047
<i>There wasn't any time to</i>
<i>observe its moves!</i>

05:27.047 --> 05:28.217
<i>Damn it!</i>

05:51.127 --> 05:52.377
Now! Eight-O!

06:00.677 --> 06:01.797
Tailed Beast...

06:01.837 --> 06:03.587
Bomb Barrage!

06:05.927 --> 06:07.507
There's no need to dodge.

06:08.127 --> 06:11.257
I want to preserve Ten Tails' power
as much as possible.

06:17.337 --> 06:18.127
<i>This is...</i>

06:19.297 --> 06:20.377
<i>... not good!</i>

06:44.927 --> 06:46.467
It's all on you now!

07:00.257 --> 07:02.127
Persistent lot!

07:02.177 --> 07:05.127
Hey, Naruto, don't tell me...

07:05.127 --> 07:08.007
Don't worry Bushier Brow Sensei.

07:10.087 --> 07:12.377
Nice control, Naruto!

07:14.337 --> 07:16.007
You got them in nice and close!

07:16.627 --> 07:18.877
<i>We focused too much on Ten Tails.</i>

07:19.337 --> 07:21.217
<i>Sorry about the one leg.</i>

07:21.677 --> 07:22.927
<i>But here we go!</i>

07:24.467 --> 07:25.297
<i>Kamui!</i>

07:26.257 --> 07:27.047
Yeah!

07:27.217 --> 07:31.927
It just looks like one octopus leg
got left behind, but...

07:32.757 --> 07:34.177
Bee! Eight Tails!

07:34.427 --> 07:38.087
Operation Octopus Pot!
Sorry it's a mean and cowardly plot!

07:40.257 --> 07:43.047
<i>I'm gonna smash this</i>
<i>into his eyeball!</i>

07:46.217 --> 07:47.177
<i>Get him!</i>

07:51.967 --> 07:52.547
Huh?!

07:57.087 --> 07:59.177
There are two flies above us as well...

08:06.467 --> 08:07.627
<i>The Ten Tails' tail?!</i>

08:08.087 --> 08:09.127
Naruto!

08:14.127 --> 08:15.217
<i>Kakashi!</i>

08:21.087 --> 08:25.127
<i>Naruto, you really are
<i>a lot like me.</i></i>

08:28.627 --> 08:32.087
<i>That's right,
<i>you're just younger than me.</i></i>

08:32.217 --> 08:33.337
<i>Eventually...</i>

08:41.087 --> 08:44.427
<i>Forgive me, Eight-O and Octopops!</i>

08:46.337 --> 08:48.587
Another Shadow Clone, huh?

09:20.127 --> 09:21.257
Kurama!

09:21.467 --> 09:23.297
How can you fall apart
at a time like this?!

09:23.717 --> 09:25.127
That was about eight minutes.

09:25.837 --> 09:28.837
It's longer than before,
but that's the limit.

09:29.377 --> 09:32.127
I'm going to have to infuse
and build up my chakra.

09:34.717 --> 09:35.967
Guess we have no choice.

09:38.967 --> 09:41.967
That hurts, fool. Ya fool!

09:43.047 --> 09:43.837
Bee!

09:43.877 --> 09:46.177
I'm going to rest a bit too.
I'm also at my limit.

09:47.927 --> 09:50.337
I can't get healed yet?

09:52.047 --> 09:54.927
<i>Pulling something as massive</i>
<i>as Eight Tails in and out</i>

09:54.967 --> 09:56.677
<i>sure comes with</i>
<i>a correspondingly large cost.</i>

09:57.217 --> 09:58.127
<i>I'm drained already.</i>

10:01.627 --> 10:05.217
Seems Eight Tails and Nine Tails
have run out of chakra for now.

10:15.087 --> 10:17.047
You favorite Shadow Clone Jutsu?

10:17.297 --> 10:19.297
It may be forbidden high-level ninjutsu,

10:19.337 --> 10:21.547
but just increasing
the number of losers won't--

10:21.587 --> 10:23.087
I'm not a loser!

10:23.127 --> 10:24.217
Stop, Naruto!

10:25.047 --> 10:27.047
It's meaningless to
create Shadow Clones

10:27.087 --> 10:28.507
that will divide your chakra
even more.

10:29.217 --> 10:32.047
They might be useful as diversions,
but not for decisive hits.

10:32.507 --> 10:33.877
And if you go down...

10:34.757 --> 10:36.087
we lose this war.

10:38.087 --> 10:40.177
You were always just
a motley crew anyway.

10:40.177 --> 10:41.217
Huh?!

10:41.257 --> 10:44.377
M-M-Motley crew?

10:46.087 --> 10:47.717
Like I said, you're incompetent.

10:48.877 --> 10:52.007
He's saying that it's pointless to
merely increase the number of heads...

10:52.047 --> 10:54.217
if they're all empty.

10:55.047 --> 10:57.877
You and I are both powerless shinobi.

10:59.007 --> 11:00.087
You...

11:01.627 --> 11:04.587
no, I should say everyone...

11:06.087 --> 11:08.337
will eventually end up like me.

11:10.677 --> 11:13.177
I'll never end up like you!

11:13.507 --> 11:15.257
How many times
do I have to tell you?!

11:15.797 --> 11:17.797
My dream is to become the Hokage!

11:18.967 --> 11:20.007
Don't worry.

11:20.717 --> 11:22.217
Everything will go as planned.

11:23.007 --> 11:26.217
There is no shinobi jutsu mightier
than the Infinite Tsukuyomi.

11:27.217 --> 11:30.877
I'll make you Hokage inside this jutsu.

11:32.717 --> 11:33.547
So...

11:33.927 --> 11:36.337
Just disappear along
with the rest of this world!

12:18.877 --> 12:19.667
What the...?

12:22.287 --> 12:24.627
Did it miss? On purpose?

12:28.247 --> 12:29.377
About time!

12:30.327 --> 12:31.787
Kakashi! Guy!

12:31.917 --> 12:33.247
Sorry to keep you waiting!

12:33.957 --> 12:35.497
I can't believe he shook off

12:35.537 --> 12:38.627
my Byakugan-aided, spot-on Mind Transfer
in just two seconds!

12:39.417 --> 12:41.997
But you still succeeded in shifting
that large thing's aim off target.

12:42.247 --> 12:43.127
Good work!

12:43.327 --> 12:45.127
Are you all right, Naruto?

12:45.167 --> 12:45.917
Yeah!

12:46.327 --> 12:50.037
You don't have to act tough
in front of Hinata, Naruto!

12:50.917 --> 12:52.707
Beetle Jamming Jutsu!

12:55.667 --> 12:57.417
Hidden Mist Jutsu!

13:05.577 --> 13:06.997
We're here, Naruto!

13:07.577 --> 13:10.627
All right, we won't be
so easily detectable now!

13:11.627 --> 13:14.327
Lord Bee! You're in better shape
than I expected!

13:14.497 --> 13:16.787
Lord Bee! You look seriously wounded!

13:17.167 --> 13:19.247
Omoi, you worry too much!

13:20.127 --> 13:22.327
Guy Sensei, don't tell me
you used Hirudora?!

13:22.377 --> 13:22.997
Lee!

13:23.417 --> 13:25.377
I'm sorry we're late, Captain Kakashi.

13:26.287 --> 13:28.037
Sakura, first off...!

13:28.287 --> 13:29.207
I know!

13:35.877 --> 13:38.747
<i>The Sensory Water Sphere won't</i>
<i>maintain its original shape.</i>

13:38.787 --> 13:39.667
<i>We better...!</i>

13:40.247 --> 13:42.497
Inoichi! Ao! Confirm the situation!

13:43.077 --> 13:44.287
- Roger!
- Okay!

13:47.707 --> 13:49.377
First Company has arrived!

13:50.247 --> 13:51.827
Second Company has also arrived!

13:52.707 --> 13:54.127
Third Company has arrived!

13:54.957 --> 13:56.377
Fourth Company has arrived!

13:57.167 --> 13:58.707
Fifth Company has also arrived!

13:59.207 --> 14:00.377
The Medical Unit's here too!

14:01.417 --> 14:03.127
Sensory Unit has arrived!

14:04.577 --> 14:06.997
Nice try hiding, but...

14:13.127 --> 14:14.247
Wind Style!

14:14.457 --> 14:15.827
Art of the Gust Blade!

14:25.457 --> 14:28.577
We're not a motley crew anymore!

14:29.037 --> 14:33.417
Here is the Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu!

14:33.707 --> 14:38.037
The world's greatest, most invincible,
super-duper ninjutsu, you know!

14:38.787 --> 14:41.957
A jutsu that trumps
the Infinite Tsukuyomi. Remember that!

14:43.457 --> 14:45.417
The Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu, eh?

14:45.417 --> 14:47.377
Don't you think that's a bit of stretch?

14:47.747 --> 14:50.207
We're going to stop you two
with this jutsu!

14:50.917 --> 14:51.667
You're wrong.

14:51.707 --> 14:56.537
Why won't you realize that
it's meaningless for you to stop us here?

14:57.287 --> 15:01.207
After this war,
even that jutsu will disintegrate...

15:01.747 --> 15:03.917
Then someone from your side
will attempt to do

15:03.957 --> 15:05.747
exactly what we're doing now.

15:06.707 --> 15:09.417
There is no victory,
no matter how much you struggle.

15:12.627 --> 15:14.667
Get it through your head.

15:14.707 --> 15:17.247
There's no such thing as hope
anywhere in this world.

15:21.327 --> 15:22.327
I don't care!

15:24.417 --> 15:25.667
I'll make sure there's hope!

15:30.577 --> 15:32.127
It's meaningless to argue

15:32.167 --> 15:33.877
whether there is or isn't
something during a war.

15:34.287 --> 15:35.957
How about we settle this now?

15:36.997 --> 15:41.417
When there's a difference of opinion,
isn't the usual way majority rule?

15:42.167 --> 15:42.957
So what do we do?

15:44.457 --> 15:45.327
That's a good suggestion.

15:45.707 --> 15:46.537
Then...

15:47.787 --> 15:50.207
We'll call it after
we've erased all of you

15:51.127 --> 15:52.037
And...

15:52.417 --> 15:53.827
I knew you'd say that.

15:54.577 --> 15:55.377
But...

16:03.207 --> 16:04.417
This world...

16:07.667 --> 16:09.167
- will end!
- will not end!

16:09.667 --> 16:10.537
Let's go, everyone!

16:11.457 --> 16:13.167
This is the final deciding battle!

16:17.787 --> 16:18.667
Scatter!

16:21.327 --> 16:23.247
<i>Thanks for buying us</i>
<i>some time, Naruto.</i>

16:24.127 --> 16:26.077
Did you have enough time
to come up with a strategy?

16:26.377 --> 16:30.247
<i>Thanks to you, I was able to</i>
<i>relay it to everyone!</i>

16:31.207 --> 16:34.127
<i>Kakashi told us the masked man</i>
<i>is Obito Uchiha.</i>

16:34.167 --> 16:35.627
<i>But there's no time to be shocked.</i>

16:36.127 --> 16:38.247
<i>For this fight, we need to take</i>
<i>and maintain the upper hand</i>

16:38.287 --> 16:40.167
<i>and not give them</i>
<i>any opportunity to counter!</i>

16:40.417 --> 16:43.457
<i>According to the intel we received,</i>
<i>our enemy has impressive eyes.</i>

16:45.417 --> 16:49.957
<i>First, we'll impede their movement</i>
<i>by destroying their vision.</i>

16:50.457 --> 16:51.957
<i>The Hidden Cloud!</i>

16:55.327 --> 16:56.457
Lightning Style!

16:57.207 --> 16:58.417
Flash Pillar!

17:00.457 --> 17:03.537
Gale Style! Laser Circus.

17:17.037 --> 17:18.377
I see...

17:18.827 --> 17:22.037
Their true aim is to blind Ten Tails!

17:23.457 --> 17:25.247
<i>With the two jutsu from earlier,</i>

17:25.247 --> 17:27.497
<i>the Hidden Mist's Mist</i>
<i>and the Beetle Jamming...</i>

17:27.787 --> 17:30.537
<i>Along with the large volume</i>
<i>of airborne dust</i>

17:30.577 --> 17:32.247
<i>stirred up by the Gale Style right now...</i>

17:33.287 --> 17:35.207
<i>The Hidden Sand, now!</i>

17:36.377 --> 17:38.627
Wind Style: Air Current Dance!

17:41.827 --> 17:44.167
<i>We'll not just destroy</i>
<i>their vision completely,</i>

17:44.207 --> 17:47.287
<i>but thwart them from</i>
<i>even sensing us at all.</i>

17:47.627 --> 17:50.037
<i>And since their sheer bulk</i>
<i>prevents them from hiding...</i>

17:50.077 --> 17:53.207
<i>we'll be able to take</i>
<i>full advantage of the situation.</i>

17:53.827 --> 17:56.537
<i>We only revealed our jutsu</i>
<i>to him a short while ago,</i>

17:56.577 --> 17:59.377
<i>and he's already incorporating them</i>
<i>into the battle plan!</i>

17:59.827 --> 18:01.917
<i>Leave it to Shikamaru's dad,</i>
<i>like father like son!</i>

18:10.627 --> 18:12.827
This makes it impossible to sense them.

18:13.537 --> 18:16.707
We'll wipe them all out with
a Ten Tails' attack!

18:17.287 --> 18:19.787
<i>The Hidden Stone,</i>
<i>proceed immediately!</i>

18:20.327 --> 18:21.287
We know!

18:22.957 --> 18:25.667
Earth Style: Vast Mobile Core!

18:32.127 --> 18:34.997
<i>After shutting down their senses,</i>
<i>we'll immobilize them!</i>

18:41.577 --> 18:43.827
<i>As soon as we bring down</i>
<i>the Ten Tails, pour in quicklime!</i>

18:44.537 --> 18:47.577
- Lava Style: Quicklime Jutsu!
- Lava Style: Quicklime Jutsu!

18:52.457 --> 18:54.327
<i>Hidden Mist! You're up next!</i>

18:55.127 --> 18:57.707
- Water Style: Water Bomb Jutsu!
- Water Style: Water Bomb Jutsu!

18:58.537 --> 19:00.417
<i>We'll add water to the mix,</i>

19:00.457 --> 19:03.327
<i>and rapidly stir up the quicklime!</i>

19:05.077 --> 19:07.247
<i>Hidden Leaf! Let's finish this!</i>

19:08.287 --> 19:09.707
Sarutobi Clan members!

19:10.167 --> 19:10.917
Let's go!

19:11.417 --> 19:13.327
Fire Style: Majestic Flame Jutsu!

19:13.997 --> 19:16.707
<i>And we'll dry it with the heat</i>
<i>from the Fire Style...</i>

19:27.787 --> 19:29.877
<i>Let it set and immobilize it!</i>

19:32.537 --> 19:33.537
Unbelievable.

19:35.787 --> 19:37.457
Who would've thought,

19:37.497 --> 19:40.577
that the ninja from the five villages
could work so cooperatively.

19:44.827 --> 19:47.127
<i>Unless we stop the Ten Tails,</i>

19:47.167 --> 19:49.377
<i>we don't have a chance</i>
<i>to go after Obito or Madara.</i>

19:49.787 --> 19:53.747
<i>The Ten Tails is merely a tool</i>
<i>for them to aid in activating their jutsu.</i>

19:54.127 --> 19:56.577
<i>If we cut off the head from the body,</i>
<i>namely those two...</i>

19:56.627 --> 19:59.287
<i>Infinite Tsukuyomi cannot</i>
<i>be activated!</i>

20:00.247 --> 20:03.327
<i>But keep in mind that</i>
<i>we won't be able to suppress</i>

20:03.377 --> 20:05.457
<i>the Ten Tails' power for too long.</i>

20:06.457 --> 20:08.627
<i>Only physical attacks work</i>
<i>on Madara.</i>

20:08.997 --> 20:11.667
<i>So shinobi who are skilled</i>
<i>in taijutsu will go after Madara!</i>

20:12.997 --> 20:15.287
<i>Obito can slip through</i>
<i>all moves and jutsu,</i>

20:15.327 --> 20:18.457
<i>but according to our intel,</i>
<i>that only lasts for five minutes.</i>

20:19.207 --> 20:20.497
<i>Coordinate with the Medical Unit and</i>

20:20.537 --> 20:22.747
<i>keep attacking him</i>
<i>for more than five minutes!</i>

20:22.787 --> 20:23.667
<i>Do not let up!</i>

20:24.167 --> 20:25.957
<i>That's right, Naruto...</i>

20:26.247 --> 20:27.997
<i>It's now time for your...</i>

20:37.377 --> 20:39.957
Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu!

20:42.327 --> 20:43.457
How pitiful.

20:44.167 --> 20:44.917
Yeah.

20:46.417 --> 20:49.497
This hope that they're clinging to
doesn't exist.

20:50.167 --> 20:54.457
Just like their very lives,
at this point.

20:56.167 --> 20:58.747
It seems Ten Tails... is ready.

